      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wa misumba udi wamba ne, Monai, ndi ntuma messager wanyi, yeye nealongolole nshila ku mpala kuanyi; Mukelenge unudi nukeba nealue lubilu mu ntempelo wandi, messager wa dihungila, unudi nʼandi disanka, monai mudiye ulua! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi nganyi wamanya mua kushala holâ mu dituku dia kulua kuandi? Nganyi washindama hamuenekeye?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua yeye udi bu kahia ka mukunjishi wa biamu, ne bu nsabanga wa musukuidi wa bilulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye neashikame hanshi ukunjisha ne ulengesha tshiamu tshia argent, nealengeshe bana ba Lewi. Neabakenkeshe bu or ne argent, bua bobo bikale kudi Yehowa bu bantu badi bafila milambu kudiye mu buakane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe, mulambu wa Yuda ne wa Yelushalema neyisankishe Yehowa, bu muakamusankishayi mu matuku a kale ne mu bidimu biakamana kuhita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wa misumba udi wamba ne, Nensemene ba buihi nʼenu bua kulumbulula bilumbu bienu; nengikale mumonyi udi utuisha batempeshi ba mbuku ne bena masandi lubilu, bantu badi baditshiha ne mitshihu ya mashimi, badi bakengesha muena mudimu hadibo bamufuta difutu diandi ne mukashi wa mu lufuila ne muanʼa nshiya, bantu badi bakengesha muntu wa tshisamba tshia bende ne badi kabayi bantshina mene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua meme Yehowa tshitu ngakudimuka, nunku nuenu, bana ba Yakoba, kanuena nubutuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu matuku a batatu benu tô ne mpindiu nuakûmuka ku mikenji yanyi, kanuakuyitabusha. Yehowa wa misumba udi wamba ne, Hinganai kundi ne meme nempingane kunudi. Kadi nudi nuamba ne, Netuhingane munyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu neibe bintu bia Nzambi, anyi? Kadi nudi nuiba bintu bianyi! Nudi nunkonka ne, Tuakuiba bintu biebe kudi kunyi? Nku tshia dikumi tshia bintu ne ku bintu binudi nufila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuakuedibua mulau, bualu bua nudi nuiba bintu bianyi, bonso ba mu tshisamba etshi mene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luai ne tshia dikumi tshionso mu nsubu wa kubutshila bintu, bua bia kudia bikale mu nsubu muanyi; Yehowa wa misumba udi wamba ne, Nuntete mpindiu ne muanda eu, numone bingikala tshiyi mununzuluile bibi bia mu diulu, munulokeshile masanka, kanuyi nukengela bintu bikuabo kabidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wa misumba udi wamba ne, Nenkanyine mudi wa bia kudia, bua yeye kabutudi bintu bidi buloba buenu bumenesha; ne muonshi wenu wa tumuma mu budimi kawena uhohoka tumuma tua nvinyo hatshididi tubishe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wa misumba udi wamba ne, Ba mu bisamba bionso nebanubikile ne, Basankishibue; bualu bua nenuikale bena buloba budi ne disanka dimpe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa udi wamba ne, Mei enu akadi annyoka. Kadi nuenu nudi nunkonka ne, Tuakukunyoka munyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuakuamba ne, Kukuatshila Yehowa mudimu kudi muanda wa hatuhu; tuakuangata difutu kai hatuakutumikila mei andi ne hatuakuenda baluate bivualu bia madilu ku mpala kua Yehowa wa misumba? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpindiu tudi tubikila badi badisue ne, Badi ne dikasa dimpe; bulelela, benji ba malu mabi hadi bajadikibua; bulelela, badi bateta Nzambi badi bahanduka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe, bakadi banemeka Yehowa bakasombeshangana, ne Yehowa wakabateleja matshu, wakabumuna, ne mukanda wa tshivulukidi wakafundibua ku mpala kuandi bua kuanyisha bantu aba bakadi batshina Nzambi ne bakadi banemeka dina diandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wa misumba udi wamba ne, Bobo nebikale banyi, mu dituku dindi ngenza malu â, nebikale bantu banyi nkayanyi mene; meme nembafuile luse bu mudi muntu ufuila muanʼandi mulume udi umukuatshila mudimu luse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe, nenujingulule ditahuluka didi hankatshi ha bantu bimpe ne bantu babi, hankatshi ha badi bakuatshila Nzambi mudimu ne badi kabayi bamukuatshila mudimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
